# The API image's build context is the repository root (build.yml, docker compose).
# The Dockerfile copies named paths, apps/api among them, so a developer's own
# files under them would ride into a build made by hand: never an environment
# file (rule 9), never a dependency tree or a build output of this machine.
**/.env
**/.env.*
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.expo
